WEBVTT

00:15:29.333 --> 00:15:30.583
and she died.

00:15:31.792 --> 00:15:35.559
But I'll never forget how,
in the chaos and mayhem,

00:15:35.583 --> 00:15:38.643
when that verdict was announced,

00:15:38.667 --> 00:15:40.309
I turned to her and said,

00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:44.208
"Mrs. Manning, I'm very sorry
for your family."

00:15:45.542 --> 00:15:47.184
And she looked at me and said,

00:15:47.208 --> 00:15:50.934
"Mr. Dias, you are family."

00:15:50.958 --> 00:15:55.184
And she pointed at the prison officers
and the jury and she said,

00:15:55.208 --> 00:15:56.809
"And they are family.

00:15:56.833 --> 00:15:59.351
But families bicker and fight,

00:15:59.375 --> 00:16:01.434
but we've got to sort it out.